{"s":108,"v":[{"t":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muḥammad], al-Kawthar.","w":[["إِنَّآ","Indeed, We","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["آ",11]]],["أَعْطَيْنَـٰكَ","We have given you","aʿṭaynāka","",[["أَعْطَيْ",947],["نَ",11],["ـٰكَ",18]]],["ٱلْكَوْثَرَ","Al-Kauthar","l-kawthara","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كَوْثَرَ",4066]]]]},{"t":"So pray to your Lord and offer sacrifice [to Him alone].","w":[["فَصَلِّ","So pray","faṣalli","",[["فَ",7],["صَلِّ",730]]],["لِرَبِّكَ","to your Lord","lirabbika","",[["لِ",8],["رَبِّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["وَٱنْحَرْ","and sacrifice","wa-in'ḥar","",[["وَ",1],["ٱنْحَرْ",3055]]]]},{"t":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["شَانِئَكَ","your enemy ","shāni-aka","",[["شَانِئَ",3695],["كَ",18]]],["هُوَ","he (is)","huwa",""],["ٱلْأَبْتَرُ","the one cut off","l-abtaru","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَبْتَرُ",2841]]]]}]}